{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/iiPbwvKRIhPVt1mpk4Wr_g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:12.809247+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/iiPbwvKRIhPVt1mpk4Wr_g","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/kjPLBPL3YaexTTftolKiaLbfPTxjVh2VTia5WoPBssQTmyibdjNF4qADKoFcv1AEHudcd5lrn7Uh3VwEMFAWicZc3Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>    </span><span><span>为做好2026年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生（含直博生，以下简称推免生）工作，我校将开通推免生预报名系统，热忱欢迎广大推免生申请。</span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bE9obU0PXLFjnSyweia1fia1SYO0ml91ERneOfkehdoVdGC3TWaOcCpb8oLSgjncLSbYFsNNN3bF3KvUicQPNhuLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=1\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>接收专业</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>    <span> </span></span><span>我校公布的硕士研究生招生目录中接收应届本科毕业生报考的全日制招生专业均可接收推免生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>接收条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>     </span></span><span><span>1．纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的应届毕业生，获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>     2．具备以下条件之一者，同等条件下</span></span><span><span><span>优先接收</span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>    （1）在国内外公开出版刊物上发表过与申报专业相关的具有一定水平的学术论文者（排名第一）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>    （2）本科期间省级及以上个人奖项获得者或集体奖项的主要完成者。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>     3．</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>接收条件：本科期间学习成绩优秀，专业排名名列前茅，具有优秀研究生潜质，申请我校具有一级学科博士学位授权点（限理、工学科门类）的学术型硕士推免生，通过推免生接收考核后，可在教育部推免系统中填报直博生。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>支持政策</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>    </span></span><span><span><span> 1．</span></span><span><span>享受最高等级学业奖学金</span></span><span><span>。推免生报到入学后，第一学年可直接享受硕士研究生最高等级学业奖学金；直博生报到入学后，第一学年可直接享受博士研究生最高等级学业奖学金。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>     2．</span><span>优先选择导师</span><span>。部分学院推免生新生入校后享有优先选择导师权。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>     3．</span><span>补贴考试费用</span><span>。参加我校复试的推免生免缴考试费。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>     4．</span></span><span><span>本校推免生</span></span><span><span>录取后可进入</span></span><span><span>本硕贯通培养</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>大学四年级提前进入硕士阶段学习，并有资格在硕士一年级通过</span></span><span><span>硕博连读选拔</span></span><span><span>录取为博士研究生</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>预报名</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>     </span></span><span><span>1．预报名时间安排</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>     报名起始时间：</span><span>8月5日</span><span>，截止时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span>9月25日(暂定)</span></span></span><span><span><span>，请符合报名条件的考生登录我校推免生申请系统：</span><span>https://yz.njnu.edu.cn/login/sstm/login.jsp</span><span>，进行预报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>     2．凡通过本报名系统进行预报名，申请我校2026年推免生且符合接收条件的学生，我校将优先安排复试、优先接收。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>     3．理工科应届本科毕业生在推免生申请系统中填报我校理工科硕士研究生或教育硕士专业学位研究生，可同时申请我校</span></span><span><span>“国优计划”</span></span><span><span>专项。有关</span></span><span><span>“国优计划”</span></span><span><span>专项研究生的相关情况见我校后续通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>     </span></span><span><span><span>4．通过本系统预报名并取得推免生资格的学生，待教育部开通</span></span><span><span>推免生报名系统</span></span><span><span>后（预计</span></span><span><span>9月28日</span></span><span><span>），仍须</span></span><span><span>在教育部的推免系统中完成填报志愿等相关操作</span></span><span><span>，否则申请无效。教育部推免系统开放后，申请者应根据招生学院的要求在规定时间内完成报名、接受复试通知、接受待录取通知等操作。招生学院将根据复试成绩择优录取，录满为止。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>     5．我校将根据教育部最新推免生政策，及时公布2026年接收推免生的最新信息，请</span><span>及时关注我校研究生招生网相关信息</span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>     6．推免生考试工作由各学院负责组织，请申请者</span></span><span><span>关注学院网站通知并保持联系方式畅通</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/bE9obU0PXLGPFalLSJnT5djxmkiatxkWG3zkxKwW3cFwNiaPzn3ZHMQiaWv4ozdp4Ky1EIwc33Z9G7kSAWZrogVoA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=2\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kjPLBPL3YaexTTftolKiaLbfPTxjVh2VTygKrIiaPClia0vdtjKVLYhLejBLv2u0WjxibTA5jfkSI2zBroicMIpLfzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>来源 </span><span><span>| </span><span>南京师范大学（ID：</span></span><span>njnuxcb）</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/kjPLBPL3YaeIjEdIrH2iaXsD38xCFZL9K5icBJ0A5IuasRwaaDibXgLBVmdxMug882cv4rvZAh2qIpXqKvRFRPYiag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"99722ad111a70d5ad5c5e9269c16580863d8e70025098a772ecb39f4926774c8","textLength":1083,"sourceSha256":"49d5040f4d3ad37385d176fd47398c073d9dd1b0a533bd5c2081d72165ec3fab","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c71d2a636fac3233c86b","title":"2025年南京师范大学马克思主义学院2026年推免生接收预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:12.809247+00:00"}
